WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
First, tell the bank why you need money: crops, animals, a tractor, storage, or crop-loss support.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Carry Aadhaar, bank passbook, mobile number, and photos. Add land records or lease details, if applicable.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Explain your crop, loan amount, and current loans. Ask about interest, fees, security, and repayment dates.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Get a receipt. Confirm terms with the bank. Never share your PIN or OTP or pay an agent.
